==================== HASH MAP PATTERNS ====================

1. Need to count frequency?
→ unordered_map

Questions:
• Top K Frequent Elements
• Majority Element
• Valid Anagram
• Ransom Note
• First Unique Character
• Frequency of Characters


-----------------------------------------------------------

2. Need to know if an element is already seen?
→ unordered_map

Questions:
• Two Sum
• Contains Duplicate
• Happy Number
• Longest Consecutive Sequence


-----------------------------------------------------------

3. Need Value → Index mapping?
→ unordered_map

Questions:
• Two Sum
• Next Greater Element
• Array Index Mapping problems


-----------------------------------------------------------

4. Need Character → Character / Character → Frequency mapping?
→ unordered_map

Questions:
• Isomorphic Strings
• Valid Anagram
• Ransom Note
• First Unique Character


-----------------------------------------------------------

5. Need one key to store MULTIPLE values?
→ unordered_map<Key, vector<Value>>

Questions:
• Group Anagrams
• Group Similar Elements
• Categorization problems


-----------------------------------------------------------

6. Need Prefix Sum lookup?
→ unordered_map

Questions:
• Subarray Sum Equals K
• Continuous Subarray Sum
• Prefix Sum problems


==================== HEAP PATTERNS ====================

1. Need largest element repeatedly?
→ Max Heap (priority_queue)

Questions:
• Last Stone Weight
• Heap Sort
• Maximum Element problems


-----------------------------------------------------------

2. Need smallest element repeatedly?
→ Min Heap

Questions:
• Merge K Sorted Lists
• Smallest Range
• Kth Smallest Element


-----------------------------------------------------------

3. Top K / Kth Largest / Kth Smallest?
→ Heap

Questions:
• Kth Largest Element
• Top K Frequent Elements
• K Closest Points to Origin
• Kth Largest in Stream


